dotfiles-owl-private.example

This file documents the layout of the private key store that lives OUTSIDE
this repository, under:

    ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/dotfiles-owl-private/

Layout:

    keys/
        deepseek    # raw key file for DEEPSEEK_API_KEY
        zai         # raw key file for ZAI_API_KEY

Each file contains only the raw key value. Missing, unreadable, or empty
files leave the corresponding environment variable unset.

No values are stored in this repository. Never commit real key material or a
copy of the private store here.
